  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx : (1)/(27) :: (3)/(11) : (5)/(9)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\nx : (1)/(27) :: (3)/(11) : (5)/(9)\n\n⇒ (x)/(frac{1){27}} = (frac{3)/(11)}{(5)/(9)}\n\n⇒ x × 27 = (3)/(11)×(9)/(5)\n\n⇒ x = (27)/(55times 27)\n\n⇒ x = (1)/(55)\n\n**Hence, The Required value is (1)/(55).**",
